NOTE ON PROVENANCE

This repository contains a RECONSTRUCTION of a cohort-extraction rule set, written
against the raw MIMIC-IV v3.1 source tables during peer review. It is not the script that
produced the originally submitted export. See the "Provenance" section of README.md.

This repository contains no patient-level or derived data. Use of MIMIC-IV requires the
PhysioNet credentialed access agreement.
